--- PRC-50, 51, 52, 53, 54: non-blocking reap without waiting (HELD OUT of dispatch - direct call only, see the leaf's own comment) ---
a number called waiting is 444539226759.
a boolean called 'ledger echild refused' is false.
a number called 'ledger echild poll' is reap child 9415242 without waiting.
On error Set 'ledger echild refused' to true.
If 'ledger echild poll' is not less than 0 then, Print "ASSERT PRC-53: expected negative got {'ledger echild poll'}", Exit 95. Print 'ledger echild poll'.
If 'ledger echild refused' is false then, Print "ASSERT PRC-53: expected 1 got {'ledger echild refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'ledger echild refused'.
a number called 'the envelope' is fork the process.
If 'the envelope' is 0 then, Wait 176 milliseconds, Exit 79.
a number called 'the envelope status before poll' is the reaped status.
a boolean called 'the envelope immediate refused' is false.
a number called 'the envelope immediate poll' is reap any child process without waiting.
On error Set 'the envelope immediate refused' to true.
If 'the envelope immediate poll' is not 0 then, Print "ASSERT PRC-52: expected 0 got {'the envelope immediate poll'}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope immediate poll'.
If 'the envelope immediate refused' then, Print "ASSERT PRC-52: expected 0 got {'the envelope immediate refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope immediate refused'.
a number called 'the envelope status after poll' is the reaped status.
If 'the envelope status after poll' is not 'the envelope status before poll' then, Print "ASSERT PRC-54: expected {'the envelope status before poll'} got {'the envelope status after poll'}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope status after poll'.
Wait 676 milliseconds.
a boolean called 'the envelope later refused' is false.
a number called 'the envelope later poll' is reap any child process without waiting.
On error Set 'the envelope later refused' to true.
a boolean called 'the envelope later poll matched' is false.
If 'the envelope later poll' is 'the envelope' then, Set 'the envelope later poll matched' to true.
If 'the envelope later poll matched' is false then, Print "ASSERT PRC-51: expected 1 got {'the envelope later poll matched'}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope later poll matched'.
If 'the envelope later refused' then, Print "ASSERT PRC-51: expected 0 got {'the envelope later refused'}", Exit 95. Print 'the envelope later refused'.
If waiting is not 444539226759 then, Print "ASSERT PRC-55: expected 444539226759 got {waiting}", Exit 95. Print waiting.

